bsc: exemplars is a namespace, not a module
  it holds no `.bs` files of its own, so there is
  nothing to compile and nothing to emit — a
  namespace is erased entirely (41 §5). Name one of
  the modules under it:
      exemplars/25a-http-api-server
      exemplars/25b-websocket-handler
      exemplars/25c-event-queue-consumer
      exemplars/25d-database-querying
      exemplars/25e-dynamic-web-page
      exemplars/25f-llm-evaluation-client
      exemplars/25g-jev-server
